&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;ICHINEN AUTOS（N.Z.）LIMITED&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;EAGLE AUTO SERVICES JAPAN LIMITED&lt;/p&gt;
