  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingImpairmentLossTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -36px"&gt;※７．減損損失&lt;/p&gt;
