  <jpcrp030000-asr_E04904-000:NotesRegardingRepurchaseObligationDueToLiquidationOfAccountsReceivableTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　３．債権流動化に伴う買戻義務&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 647.99999999999999999999999999px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width: 241.33333333333333333333333333px"/&gt;
